OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fwith terror offences over an alleged
OL,8,Fplot to target the Jewish community in
OL,9,FManchester ahead of Yom Kippur, Counter
OL,10,FTerrorism Policing has said.
OL,12,FRahman Salehi, 35, of Salford and Salam
OL,13,FAhmadyan, 36, from Liverpool, who are
OL,14,Fthought to have arrived in the UK by
OL,15,Fsmall boat, are accused of preparing to
OL,16,Fcommit an act of terrorism or assisting
OL,17,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,18,Fon or before 20 September.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
